id": "3342850439183224", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974647_3342850442516557_7605210541640457357_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7DF6COyFiacQ7kNvwEMF1Xw&_nc_oc=Adr_8Go1y9hxN-n0R8LFA6KM3iuLfrrTJD05F54XGe2tKjgdYqUSQ8mytOG5lWCELXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRC7w4u_gm3qnMM-oEfuiiVtV-Np_HZWBL6jOCSFb1Stg&oe=6B006490"}, {"file_name": "MaBa.png", "id": "402372402916342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974508_402372406249675_6978485084713301365_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D23tOqplnFkQ7kNvwFcV5gn&_nc_oc=Adrvd6S8Gwh0jUaC82KwwwJlL4_ZMghocjboyE0968_rgWwQ044EDVYyIcL3OFtNTUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTJ1HtMlt5BQkAJN9GODTYTiJ4UIcv6lUZ_GQxdUBpUuQ&oe=6B00639A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "MainMenu2560x1440.png", "id": "990293449567737", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974832_990293452901070_8840274522652524177_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4POzLYW04UsQ7kNvwHPWMjJ&_nc_oc=Adr8Ya3zUz1XU66iFBojuKR_WzOqNB8IwGFtNQwWC8f9C5gT3x-V5FAve8RIkvSMYqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTSJcAnDiRcUntm7WGoOpH0XnOPPEoFqUmKNErmQ2Fv6g&oe=6B005220"}, "display_name": "Virtual Tai Chi", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Virtual Tai Chi is an immersive app designed to teach the fundamentals of Tai Chi in the comfort of your home. Perfect for beginners and enthusiasts alike, it offers a comprehensive guide to fundamental stances and movements, leading up to the mastery of a Yang-style 51 form sequence. The app is optimized for practice within a standard 11' x 12' space, making it accessible for small rooms or dedicated meditation areas. A built-in meditation timer helps you keep track of your sessions, creating a balanced experien